  "title": "Linde Announces Fourth Quarter 2025 Earnings and Conference Call Schedule",
  "summary": "Woking, UK, January 9, 2026 – Linde (Nasdaq: LIN) will release its fourth quarter 2025 financial results by 06:00 EST/midday CET on Thursday, February 5, 2026. The Company will host and webcast its conference call at 09:00 EST/15:00 CET, which will be available to the public and the media in listen-only mode.",
